paperweight-skel (0.2.19-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * start-greeter: use cage -r (rootless) so cage bypasses logind seat
    management and opens DRM/input devices directly. Logind doesn't grant
    seat access to the greeter system user's PAM session reliably.
  * postinst: add greeter user to video and input groups so cage -r can
    open /dev/dri/card0 and /dev/input/event* without seat management.

